Package: cobalebeb2027
Type: Project
Title: Poisson Local Trend Dynamic Model -- reproducibility repository
Description: Declares project-level dependencies for renv (this repository
    is not itself an R package). renv's automatic source scanner does not
    recognize pkgload::load_all("../PoissonLTDM") as a dependency on the
    PoissonLTDM package, so it -- and PoissonLTDM's own LinkingTo/Imports
    chain (RcppArmadillo, Matrix, lattice) -- are declared explicitly here
    instead. See PoissonLTDM/DESCRIPTION for the package's own dependencies.
Imports:
    PoissonLTDM,
    Matrix,
    RcppArmadillo,
    lattice
Remotes:
    local::./PoissonLTDM
